+/***********************************************************************************************
+ * ObjectClass::CNC3D_Set_Invincible -- Turns damage immunity on or off for one house.         *
+ *                                                                                             *
+ *    Sets or clears one house's bit in the invincibility mask. Every object that house owns   *
+ *    stops taking damage while the bit is set; nothing else about the object changes, so the  *
+ *    enemy still targets it, still fires at it and still reacts to it.                        *
+ *                                                                                             *
+ * INPUT:   house -- The house to change. HOUSE_NONE is ignored, since unowned objects          *
+ *                   (terrain) answer HOUSE_NONE from Owner() and must never be covered.       *
+ *                                                                                             *
+ *          on    -- True to make the house invincible, false to restore normal damage.        *
+ *                                                                                             *
+ * OUTPUT:  none                                                                               *
+ *                                                                                             *
